# Machine-local, cross-tool, and generated artifacts — never committed.
#
# The committed source of truth for skills is the neutral top-level `skills/`.
# Every harness-specific path below is GENERATED by setup (per-skill links into
# `.claude/skills/`, `.agents/skills/`, and their user-scope equivalents) so no
# single coding agent is privileged in the repo.

# Claude Code discovery dir — fully generated by setup (per-skill links +
# upstream skill-creator/mcp-builder). settings.json is committed and lives
# outside skills/, so it is preserved.
.claude/skills/

# Cross-tool (agentskills.io) discovery junction — recreated by setup
.agents/

# Upstream skills (skill-creator, mcp-builder) — installed by setup from
# github.com/anthropics/skills, never committed here.
vendor/

# Generated MCP config (per-machine)
.mcp.json

# Machine-local overrides and project roster
CLAUDE.local.md
projects-db.md

# Secrets — belt and braces; nothing secret should ever live in this repo
.env
.env.*
*.secret
secrets/

# Eval + grading artifacts (regenerated on demand)
skills/**/evals/grades.json
skills/grades_summary.json

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
